OL,5,Aopportunity                            
OL,7,FSoon afterwards, Paxton was contacted  
OL,8,Fabout the gates and found himself      
OL,9,Fgetting a behind-the-scenes glimpse of 
OL,10,Fone of television's most anticipated   
OL,11,Fproductions.                           
